Build type: meson
Source: https://archive.mesa3d.org/mesa-25.3.6.tar.xz
Build order: foundation, after LLVM 19.1.7 and LibGLVnd 1.7.0, before Mutter 48.7.
Bump from ISO Mesa 19.3.3 (provides gbm.pc >= 21.3 for Mutter native backend).
glvnd=enabled (requires LibGLVnd >= 1.3.2; NVIDIA glvnd ICDs preserved). LLVM via llvm-config (shared dylib).
Drivers: llvmpipe + radeonsi; Vulkan disabled (NVIDIA provides its own).
Build-time: python-mako >= 0.8, flex, bison, python3 >= 3.9, libdrm >= 2.4.119, zlib, expat.
